cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data pipeline, please cite the working paper."
title: "Buy versus Rent in England: A Cash-Flow-Matched Horse Race, 2005-2026"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cimprich
    given-names: Martin
    affiliation: "Queen Mary University of London, School of Economics and Finance"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Martin-Cimprich/buy-vs-rent-england"
license: MIT
version: "2.1.0"
date-released: 2026-09-10
abstract: >-
  Replication package for a monthly, cash-flow-matched buy-versus-rent
  comparison on official English data, January 2005 to June 2026. Includes the
  simulation engine, the data pipeline, every result table, and a
  dependency-free online calculator. The paper is distributed as a PDF; its
  LaTeX sources are not part of the repository.
